                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed italic">
                            "Give me a 10,000-line complex and intricate Python project."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        What began as a simple challenge to an AI agent evolved into a comprehensive exploration of agentic AI capabilities in enterprise software development. Originally conceived as a component for another project under construction, TaskFlow was repurposed as a personal research initiative to systematically test AI models against complex, real-world software engineering challenges. The goal: push agentic AI to its limits with a production-ready system that would reveal each model's strengths, weaknesses, and practical applications in modern software development.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- System Architecture Deep Dive -->
                <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                            <i class="fas fa-sitemap text-white text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-purple-400">Enterprise Architecture</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">TaskFlow represents a sophisticated, production-ready distributed task processing system spanning 34 Python modules with enterprise-grade capabilities:</p>
                    
                    <!-- Core Components -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-purple-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-400 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-engine mr-3"></i>Task Engine Core
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>TaskRegistry:</strong> Automatic task function registration via decorators</li>
                                <li><strong>TaskExecutor:</strong> Async/sync task execution with timeout handling</li>
                                <li><strong>TaskEngine:</strong> Main orchestrator for submission, cancellation, retry logic</li>
                                <li><strong>Health Monitoring:</strong> Comprehensive system health checks</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-red-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-400 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-database mr-3"></i>Queue Management
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>Priority Queues:</strong> Critical, High, Normal, Low priority levels</li>
                                <li><strong>Delayed Execution:</strong> Scheduled/cron-like task processing</li>
                                <li><strong>Connection Handling:</strong> Auto-reconnection with exponential backoff</li>
                                <li><strong>Real-time Statistics:</strong> Performance metrics and monitoring</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-green-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-users mr-3"></i>Worker System
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>Distributed Processing:</strong> Multi-worker task execution</li>
                                <li><strong>Configurable Concurrency:</strong> Adjustable worker pool sizes</li>
                                <li><strong>Queue Specialization:</strong> Workers for specific queue types</li>
                                <li><strong>Auto Recovery:</strong> Health monitoring and automatic restart</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-blue-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-globe mr-3"></i>API & Web Interface
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>FastAPI Backend:</strong> RESTful API with comprehensive endpoints</li>
                                <li><strong>WebSocket Support:</strong> Real-time updates and notifications</li>
                                <li><strong>Web Dashboard:</strong> Live monitoring and management interface</li>
                                <li><strong>Health Endpoints:</strong> System status and diagnostics</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
